    "html": "<h1 data-chunk-id=\"451468cc-0fd1-4b19-87a8-2231f185697a\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;border-bottom:3px solid #0d47a1;padding-bottom:6px\">Nebula Drift - Art Bible</h1>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"16a798bf-2156-452b-b409-7d5c13948463\" style=\"background-color:#e3f2fd;border-left:4px solid #1565c0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:9pt;color:#37474f\">Vantage Nine Studios - internal - sub-document of the Nebula Drift GDD.</p>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"a2801426-5018-4e64-958b-2ae2a43c49b6\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Silhouette rules</h2>\n<ul data-chunk-id=\"529bdf2f-a12d-4504-9521-cfabaf8d1d90\">\n<li>Every hazard must be identifiable as a black shape at 40 px.</li>\n<li>Traversable geometry is warm; lethal geometry is cold. No exceptions.</li>\n<li>Detail budget goes to edges, not surfaces.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"50294162-271d-4513-a82d-a57d2bd17f92\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Palette</h2>\n<table data-chunk-id=\"0986cbb1-626e-468f-b3ea-02b1145edd0d\" style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #37474f;font-family:Inter , Calibri , Arial , sans-serif;font-size:10pt\"><thead><tr>\n<th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Role</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Hex</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #37474f;background-color:#0d47a1;color:#ffffff;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left;font-weight:bold\">Used for</th>\n</tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Traversable</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">#E8A33D</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Ledges, grapple points, anything the player may touch</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Lethal</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">#3D6FE8</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Coolant, vacuum breaches, crushers</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Neutral hull</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">#37474F</td>\n<td style=\"border:1px solid #90a4ae;padding:6px 8px;vertical-align:top\">Everything else</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 data-chunk-id=\"e797e9bc-a42f-4e4e-958c-f13573ee844b\" style=\"color:#0d47a1;margin-top:18px\">Concept art</h2>\n<p data-chunk-id=\"13247253-520e-439a-bb40-35fe2b21252b\">Reference boards live in this section. Each image is captioned with the\nsector it belongs to and the date it was approved.</p>",
